infra
# contracts/ is the proto source of truth — libraries/proto-contracts
# resolves srcDir("${rootProject.projectDir}/contracts/proto") at Gradle
# configuration time, so every Java service that depends on proto-contracts
# needs this directory present in the Docker build context to regenerate
# the proto-derived classes. Services that don't reference any generated
# proto types (e.g. ads-service) compile without this, which is why the
# bug was latent from PR #2 until analytics-ingest grew a PaymentEvent /
# OrderEvent import and every main-branch build started failing.
